ent-CMUFoodMeatPreyHumanCooked = seared prey steak
    .desc = A thick cut of prey, seared over a Lodge fire. No hunter asks what it was.

ent-CMUFoodMeatPreyXenoCooked = seared serpent cut
    .desc = A cut of serpent flesh with the acid cooked out of it. It keeps for a long time.

ent-CMUYautjaWaterFlask = hide water flask
    .desc = A flask stitched from cured hide. It holds water and nothing a Bad Blood would rather drink.

cmu-yautja-cloak-blocked-starving = You are too starved to hold the cloak together.
cmu-bad-blood-drink-refused = You spit out everything that is not water.
